{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお昼過ぎから\nずーっとみんなと一緒でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一日がながくて短かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も朝からみんなと一緒で\n明後日も明々後日も\nまたその次の日も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の楽屋は\n左隣が未央奈で\n右隣がかりんだったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/9812397/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/9812397/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねむたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/9812397/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんから\n選抜発表のブログのことを\n言われて、気持ちをまとめなきゃな～って\n考えて昨日の夜中携帯の画面と\n2時間ちょっと戦ってたんですが\n今日もまだ載せられなさそう。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなに、濃いことも\n長い文章でもないんだけど、\nなんか迷いがある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バシッと自分の気持ちが言えない感じが\n自分の中で嫌で、あげられずにいる。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり自分の気持ちを\n言葉で表すのって難しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"言葉ではない気持ちを感じたりしたとき\nこの気持ちはどういう言葉で\n話せばいいんだろうって考えるんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えるんだけど、\n言葉も知らないし\n気持ちの処理の仕方もわからないから\n一旦置いておこう。ってなっちゃう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、必ず1文でも書きたいから\nもう少しまっててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんがまってるような\nそんな気持ちや言葉ではないかもしれないけど、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/02/9812397/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活動をもっと楽しみたい！"}],"source":"archive"}